{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bcf49b44-1e55-4ad6-8e03-a262daca2184",
    "name": "Parking · E2E check-in",
    "description": "Flujo de entrada al parking, de principio a fin.\n\nTiene dos carpetas que hacen **lo mismo por dos caminos distintos**:\n\n1. **Simulacion manual** — encadena a mano las llamadas a vehicle, tariff, spot y\n   ticket. Funciona hoy. **No es una prueba del sistema**: nadie orquesta nada, lo\n   orquesta Postman. Es un sustituto temporal, dicho en voz alta.\n2. **Check-in real** — una sola llamada a `POST /v1/stays/check-in`. Es la que\n   cuenta. Requiere stay levantado desde `feature/checkin-usecase` y arrastra los\n   bugs listados en el README.\n\nEl dia que el check-in real funcione E2E, la carpeta 1 se borra.\n\nEjecutalas en orden con el Collection Runner y el environment\n'Parking - Local (dev)' seleccionado.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Simulacion manual (sustituto temporal)",
      "description": "Encadena servicios a mano porque la orquestacion todavia no existe en codigo. Util para probar cada pieza; NO demuestra que el sistema funcione.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preparar: crear tarifa activa",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "tariffs"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin tarifa activa para el tipo de vehiculo no hay importe que aplicar. En el flujo real la resolveria stay via `StayTariffPort`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"E2E - tarifa coche\",\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\",\n  \"pricePerMinute\": 0.05,\n  \"basePrice\": 1.0,\n  \"active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('tariffId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Preparar: crear plaza libre",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Necesitamos al menos una plaza AVAILABLE del tipo correcto, o el paso de ocupar fallara por RN-01.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('spotId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 1 - Dar de alta el vehiculo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "vehicles"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Equivale al `getOrCreateVehicle` de `StayVehiclePort`: si la matricula no existe, se crea.\n\nGenera una matricula aleatoria para poder reejecutar el flujo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\",\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"brand\": \"Seat\",\n  \"model\": \"Ibiza\",\n  \"color\": \"Blanco\",\n  \"numDoors\": 5,\n  \"hasSidecar\": false,\n  \"active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const digits = String(Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000));",
                  "const abc = 'BCDFGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ';",
                  "let letters = '';",
                  "for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {",
                  "  letters += abc.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * abc.length));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.environment.set('plate', digits + letters);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('vehicleId', body.uniqueId);",
                  "pm.test('activo (RN-11 lo dejaria pasar)', () => pm.expect(body.active).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 2 - Comprobar RN-11 (vehiculo activo)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlVehicle}}/v1/vehicles/plate/{{plate}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlVehicle}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "vehicles",
                "plate",
                "{{plate}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "RN-11: un vehiculo desactivado no puede entrar. En el flujo real esta comprobacion vive dentro del `CheckInUseCase`; aqui la hacemos a mano."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('RN-11: el vehiculo esta activo', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().active).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 3 - Resolver la tarifa aplicable",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs/active?type=CAR",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "tariffs",
                "active"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "{{vehicleType}}",
                  "description": "tipo de vehiculo"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lo que hara `StayTariffPort` cuando el adaptador real sustituya al `StubStayTariffAdapter` (que hoy devuelve un id fijo)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('hay al menos una tarifa activa', () => pm.expect(body.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (body.length > 0) pm.environment.set('tariffId', body[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 4 - Ocupar plaza (RN-01)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots/occupy",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots",
                "occupy"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El corazon del check-in. Si no hay plaza libre del tipo pedido, aqui salta **RN-01 (parking completo)**.\n\nRecuerda: el body es `{\"type\": ...}`, y el verbo es **POST** (el adaptador de stay usa PATCH por error).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('spotId', body.id);",
                  "pm.test('plaza ocupada', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('OCCUPIED'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 5 - [STUB] Emitir ticket de entrada",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlTicket}}/v1/entry-tickets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlTicket}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "entry-tickets"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ultimo paso del check-in real. **Hoy no hace nada**: `createEntryTicket` es `return null` -> 200 con cuerpo vacio.\n\nNo cortes el flujo por esto; simplemente el conductor se queda sin ticket impreso.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"stayId\": \"{{stayId}}\",\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"issuedAt\": \"2026-07-23T08:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('el endpoint responde', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "if (!pm.response.text()) {",
                  "  console.log('ticket-service sigue sin implementar: cuerpo vacio');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Limpieza - Liberar la plaza",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots/{{spotId}}/release",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots",
                "{{spotId}}",
                "release"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Deja el parking como estaba para poder reejecutar la coleccion. En el flujo real esto es la salida (HU-02) o la compensacion IN-25."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('plaza libre otra vez', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('AVAILABLE'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Check-in real (una sola llamada)",
      "description": "El flujo tal y como debe quedar. Requiere la rama feature/checkin-usecase.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preparar: plaza libre",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Una plaza AVAILABLE para que el check-in tenga donde meter el coche.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('spotId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Check-in",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlStay}}/v1/stays/check-in",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlStay}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "stays",
                "check-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Esto sustituye a los 5 pasos de la carpeta 1.** Una peticion: stay resuelve el vehiculo, aplica RN-11 y CB-05, ocupa plaza (RN-01), crea la estancia y compensa si algo falla (IN-25).\n\nRequisitos: stay levantado desde `feature/checkin-usecase`, con vehicle y spot arriba y `services.vehicle.url` / `services.spot.url` apuntando a ellos.\n\n> **Hoy esto falla** por el `.patch()` de `StaySpotClientAdapter` (spot expone POST /occupy -> 405) y porque el auto-alta del vehiculo no manda `active`, que vehicle exige. Ver README.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"vehicleType\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const digits = String(Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000));",
                  "const abc = 'BCDFGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ';",
                  "let letters = '';",
                  "for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {",
                  "  letters += abc.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * abc.length));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.environment.set('plate', digits + letters);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created — barrera abierta', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('stayId', body.stayId);",
                  "pm.environment.set('spotId', body.spotId);",
                  "pm.test('estancia creada', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.stayId).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.spotId).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('IN_PROGRESS');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verificar: la plaza quedo ocupada",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots/{{spotId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots",
                "{{spotId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "La prueba de que el check-in llego de verdad hasta spot-service: la plaza que devolvio el check-in tiene que estar en `OCCUPIED`.\n\nSi esta `AVAILABLE`, la llamada saliente de stay no funciono."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('la plaza del check-in esta OCCUPIED', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('OCCUPIED'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verificar: reentrar da 409 (CB-05)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlStay}}/v1/stays/check-in",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlStay}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "stays",
                "check-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Misma matricula, segunda vez: **409**. Es la prueba de IN-02/CB-05 (un vehiculo no puede estar dentro dos veces).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"vehicleType\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('409 Conflict', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
                  "pm.test('la barrera sigue cerrada (no se creo estancia)', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(409));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Checkout real (una sola llamada)",
      "description": "Cierre de la estancia abierta en la carpeta 2. Requiere el fix de contrato stay<->tariff y stay<->ticket (PRs #35 de stay-service y #40 de ticket-service, ya en release).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preparar: plaza libre",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Una plaza AVAILABLE para el check-in previo al checkout."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('spotId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Preparar: check-in",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlStay}}/v1/stays/check-in",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlStay}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "stays",
                "check-in"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"vehicleType\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Abre la estancia que vamos a cerrar a continuacion. Matricula nueva en cada corrida (prerequest)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const digits = String(Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000));",
                  "const abc = 'BCDFGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ';",
                  "let letters = '';",
                  "for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {",
                  "  letters += abc.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * abc.length));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.environment.set('plate', digits + letters);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('stayId', body.stayId);",
                  "pm.environment.set('spotId', body.spotId);",
                  "pm.test('estancia en curso', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('IN_PROGRESS'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Checkout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlStay}}/v1/stays/check-out",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlStay}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "stays",
                "check-out"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Cierra la estancia: calcula el importe contra tariff-service (POST /v1/tariffs/calculate), emite el ticket de salida contra ticket-service (POST /v1/tickets) y libera la plaza.\n\nSin las PRs #35/#40 mergeadas esto da 500 (contrato roto stay<->tariff y stay<->ticket, y un bean fantasma en ticket-service)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('ticketId', body.ticketId);",
                  "pm.test('estancia FINISHED', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('FINISHED'));",
                  "pm.test('importe calculado (> 0)', () => pm.expect(body.amount).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.test('ticket de salida emitido', () => pm.expect(body.ticketId).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verificar: la plaza quedo libre otra vez",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots/{{spotId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "spots",
                "{{spotId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prueba de que el checkout libero la plaza de verdad: tiene que volver a AVAILABLE."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
